As the world becomes increasingly reliant on digital tools, a growing demographic—older adults—faces unique challenges in navigating technology. For many, the transition to digital platforms can feel like a steep learning curve, with complex interfaces and unfamiliar jargon creating barriers to financial literacy and inclusion.  

